cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Unpublished local alpha. If you discuss or reuse it, identify the exact version and commit and describe it as a synthetic-data workflow demonstration."
title: "Blot Workbench / 印迹工作台"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Gaoyuan"
version: "0.1.0-alpha.1"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An unpublished local browser-based Western blot workflow demonstration using synthetic images
  and preset illustrative results. This alpha explores project organization,
  sample identity, ROI review, parameter snapshots, and resumable work.
  It is not a validated tool for quantifying experimental images.
keywords:
  - Western blot
  - research software
  - workflow
  - synthetic data
